<title>MEXICO: Sistema Argos sets 0.16 peso dividend.</title>
<headline>Sistema Argos sets 0.16 peso dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bottler Sistema Argos said on Monday it will pay an annual cash dividend of 0.16 pesos per share.</p>
<p>The bottler of Coca-Cola Co products said in a newspaper announcement that the dividend will be paid beginning May 22.</p>
<p>Last year the company paid a 0.086 peso dividend per share.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
